                    'A cinematic editorial portrait of a cybernetic warrior in neon Tokyo rain, volumetric lighting, 8k resolution, highly detailed',
                    'A vibrant 3D isometric cutaway of a cozy coffee shop library, miniature diorama style, warm golden hour sunlight',
                    'A whimsical watercolor illustration of an astronaut tending to glowing bonsai trees on Mars',
                    'Bold graphic typography poster with the word "FUTURE" emerging from geometric obsidian crystal structures'
